-- mod_arpg m6-any-race-class fix (2026-11-26): the race/class generator had ORed new races' bits into EVERY
-- playercreateinfo_cast_spell row naming a class, including race-specific intro spells - a new Pandaren got the Undead's
-- "Rigor Mortis" (73523, lies rooted on the ground), an Undead Monk the Pandaren monk's starting quest, etc. This table only
-- holds race/class intro spells (start-zone scenes, hunter pets, stances), so it goes back to the stock rows (from the
-- 2026-11-21 world dump); gen_any_race_class.py no longer touches it. Idempotent.
